{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/cv-lamaran/layout,_N_T_/tools/cv-lamaran/page,_N_T_/tools/cv-lamaran"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-2718004965b0207a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2117-c5687b942395652d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f30bb01764683cd9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/cv-lamaran/page-efab348833a93d1c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-8K10RNGN76\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><title>Generator CV &amp; Surat Lamaran Kerja ATS Friendly - Khusus Lulusan SMK | TugasMu</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Buat CV dan Surat Lamaran Kerja otomatis yang lolos sistem ATS HRD. Dirancang khusus untuk Fresh Graduate lulusan SMK agar cepat dapat panggilan kerja.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Cv lamaran</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Generator CV &amp; Surat Lamaran Kerja (Otomatis)</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Baru lulus SMK dan bingung cara melamar kerja? Masukkan jurusan dan tempat PKL-mu, AI HRD kami akan membuatkan draf <em>Cover Letter</em> dan teks CV berstandar ATS yang dilirik oleh perusahaan.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-bold shadow-sm\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option><option value=\"10\">Kelas <!-- -->10</option><option value=\"11\">Kelas <!-- -->11</option><option value=\"12\">Kelas <!-- -->12</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option><option value=\"Bahasa Indonesia\">Bahasa Indonesia</option><option value=\"Matematika\">Matematika</option><option value=\"Bahasa Inggris\">Bahasa Inggris</option><option value=\"Agama\">Agama</option><option value=\"PPKn\">PPKn</option><option value=\"Sejarah Indonesia\">Sejarah Indonesia</option><option value=\"PJOK\">PJOK</option><option value=\"Kejuruan\">Kejuruan</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Nama Lengkap</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Rina Aulia\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Posisi yang Dilamar</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Staff Administrasi / Teknisi\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Pengalaman PKL / Organisasi / Magang</label><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Pernah PKL di PT Maju Mundur sebagai admin input data selama 3 bulan.\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all resize-none disabled:opacity-50\"></textarea></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Soft Skills (Opsional)</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Disiplin, Komunikasi baik, Bisa kerja tim\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">work</span><span>Buat Surat Lamaran &amp; CV</span></button></form><div class=\"mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-sky-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase w-6 h-6 text-sky-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Rahasia Lolos Seleksi HRD bagi Fresh Graduate SMK</h2><p>Mencari kerja bagi lulusan baru (<em>Fresh Graduate</em>) SMK memiliki tantangannya sendiri. Kamu bersaing dengan ribuan pelamar lain yang mungkin memiliki jenjang pendidikan lebih tinggi atau pengalaman lebih banyak. Kunci utamanya ada pada dokumen pertamamu: <strong>Surat Lamaran (Cover Letter)</strong> dan <strong>Curriculum Vitae (CV)</strong>.</p><h3>Apa itu ATS-Friendly?</h3><p>Banyak perusahaan besar sekarang menggunakan <em>Applicant Tracking System</em> (ATS). Ini adalah software robot milik HRD yang menyeleksi CV secara otomatis sebelum dibaca oleh manusia. CV yang terlalu banyak desain, warna-warni, atau grafik aneh-aneh (seperti <em>skill bar</em>) akan otomatis <strong>DITOLAK</strong> oleh sistem ini karena tidak terbaca.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Gunakan Template Minimalis:</strong> Hindari template Canva yang terlalu penuh desain. Gunakan format teks standar dengan *bullet points*.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Kata Kunci (Keywords):</strong> Robot ATS mencari kata kunci yang cocok dengan lowongan kerja. Oleh karena itu, penting memasukkan *hard skills* jurusanmu.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Tonjolkan Pengalaman PKL:</strong> Sebagai lulusan SMK, nilai jual utamamu adalah masa magang (Prakerin/PKL). Tuliskan sebagai pengalaman kerja pertamamu.</span></li></ul><h3>Peran Penting Surat Lamaran (Cover Letter)</h3><p>Surat lamaran bukan sekadar formalitas &quot;berikut saya lampirkan CV&quot;. Surat ini adalah tempat kamu &#x27;menjual diri&#x27;. Paragraf pertama harus langsung menarik perhatian, paragraf kedua membuktikan kamu punya *skill* yang dibutuhkan, dan paragraf penutup menunjukkan antusiasme. AI TugasMu sudah merancang struktur psikologis ini secara otomatis.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Pertanyaan Seputar Pembuatan CV &amp; Lamaran</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Panduan tentang cara memaksimalkan tool ini untuk persiapan karirmu.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah CV yang dihasilkan berbentuk PDF/Gambar?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p><strong>Tidak.</strong> Tool ini menghasilkan <em>teks (copywriting)</em> berstandar ATS. Kamu harus menyalin (<em>copy</em>) teks ini dan menempelkannya (<em>paste</em>) ke dalam Microsoft Word, Google Docs, atau template CV minimalis favoritmu.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Saya belum pernah bekerja, apa yang harus ditulis di pengalaman?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Sebagai siswa SMK, pengalaman Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL), magang, atau keterlibatan aktif di Organisasi Siswa (OSIS/Pramuka/Ekskul) sangat dihitung oleh HRD. Ketikkan saja nama tempat PKL-mu beserta kegiatan yang kamu lakukan.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah bahasa yang digunakan sudah formal?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tentu saja. AI telah diprogram (sebagai konsultan karir) untuk menggunakan bahasa Indonesia baku yang sangat profesional, bebas dari *typo*, dan terstruktur rapi.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-12 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Persiapan Kerja Lainnya</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/laporan-pkl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors\">Laporan PKL</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Masih magang? Buat laporan PKL-mu di sini untuk memastikan nilai kelulusanmu maksimal sebelum melamar kerja.</p></a><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/grammar-eyd\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-li